ered a gift that should not be offered to investors.","unit_id":"u13"}],"distinction":"On this textual reading, a genuine discount on another service’s fees can fall within the exception even when used to promote a fund. This gives the unqualified exception broader reach than the product-related reading.","family":"exceptions","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The assessed actor is an intermediary distributing SFC-authorised funds in the assessed activity.","name":"is_distributor","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u1","u29"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed benefit is offered to a client in promotion of a specific fund or particular fund type, including a linkage to funds of certain fund houses.","name":"has_product_promotion_connection","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed benefit is offered and qualifies as a gift before applying the fee-discount exception; an additional return is not automatically classified as a gift.","name":"gift_offered","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u13","u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed benefit genuinely constitutes a discount of fees or charges, irrespective of which service those fees concern.","name":"is_fee_discount","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The fees or charges discounted by the assessed benefit relate to the promoted investment product or product type.","name":"discount_relates_to_promoted_product","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(and gift_offered (not is_fee_discount))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_distributor has_product_promotion_connection)"},"local_id":"r1","questions":["Does the missing FAQ confirm that discounts on unrelated services remain within the exception?"],"statement":"Selected control: paragraph-10 gift-promotion restriction, wit